WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.780
- So wait, so do you remember
the first time y'all met Jo?

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.050
- Yeah, it was a long, long time.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.080
Here's the thing: I remember.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:06.913
She doesn't remember.

00:00:06.913 --> 00:00:08.210
- Well, first of all, shut up.

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:10.360
Okay. Second, I remember.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:11.600
What I do remember, Kelly,

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.670
is that this very studio was where

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:15.880
we filmed Chelsea Lately
for like four or five years.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:17.411
- [Kelly] Yes. Yes.

00:00:17.411 --> 00:00:18.244
- Yes.
(audience applauds)

00:00:18.244 --> 00:00:22.140
And Jo, what I do remember is
Jo was a regular on that show.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:23.630
He was on my round table all the time,

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:25.421
'cause we had comedians
on and he was the best.

00:00:25.421 --> 00:00:26.360
- There was no chemistry then?

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:27.870
There was-
- Well, he says I had a crush

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.110
on him during that time.

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:30.584
I also don't recall that.

00:00:30.584 --> 00:00:31.417
(Kelly laughing)
You know?

00:00:31.417 --> 00:00:32.590
- She doesn't recall anything.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:34.690
- [Kelly] Yeah, unless
it's like selective memory?

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:37.620
- We met through a mutual
friend, Jon Lovitz.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.877
- Okay, yes.
- Oh.

00:00:38.877 --> 00:00:39.780
- And Jon Lovitz was doing
a show at the Laugh Factory.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:41.660
He was like, "You have to meet Chelsea.

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:42.813
She's hysterical.

00:00:45.357 --> 00:00:46.284
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:46.284 --> 00:00:48.866
She's my only friend on MySpace."

00:00:48.866 --> 00:00:50.325
- On MySpace!

00:00:50.325 --> 00:00:53.320
- MySpace. So I went to MySpace,
and it was really Chelsea.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.570
And then she started coming on the shows

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.240
and she told me about the show
that she was about to develop

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:01.190
and long story short,
she came up with an idea

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:02.515
that I was supposed to be on the show,

00:01:02.515 --> 00:01:03.348
and then I turned it down

00:01:03.348 --> 00:01:04.181
and then she just hated me for forever.

00:01:04.181 --> 00:01:06.750
- He says I asked him to be my sidekick.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:07.650
Remember Chewy?
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.290
- He was my little nugget sidekick.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:10.677
- [Kelly] Yes. Yes.

00:01:10.677 --> 00:01:12.640
- Well, apparently, I went to him first,

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:15.949
and Jo turned me down
and then I hired Chewy.

00:01:15.949 --> 00:01:16.782
So, Yeah.

00:01:16.782 --> 00:01:18.068
- [Jo] But she doesn't
remember any of that.

00:01:18.068 --> 00:01:18.901
- Look, you missed out.

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:20.430
Y'all could have had all
this love for that long.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:21.263
- Mm-hm, mm-hm.

00:01:21.263 --> 00:01:22.096
- [Kelly] Shame on you, Jo.

00:01:22.096 --> 00:01:24.060
- Yeah.
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:24.893
- Yeah. I used to sit there,

00:01:24.893 --> 00:01:25.810
the panel used to be right here,

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:26.740
she used to be right here,

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:27.573
and I used to look at her like this.

00:01:27.573 --> 00:01:29.390
- Oh, I loved your show.

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:30.760
Oh my gosh.

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:31.593
- He did, he did.

00:01:31.593 --> 00:01:32.833
He had a crush on me. I knew that.

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:36.890
- But I was never gonna get involved

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:38.260
with somebody on my round table.

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:39.110
You know what I mean?

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:43.108
Like, to me, they were just
like comic boys and I was,

00:01:43.108 --> 00:01:47.370
it was almost like I was a
parent in that dynamic, you know?

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:48.830
I mean, I'm sure nobody thought of me

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:49.972
as their mother now, but.

00:01:49.972 --> 00:01:51.412
- [Kelly] Do you play mommy now, or?

00:01:51.412 --> 00:01:52.390
I'm just kidding. I'm just kidding.

00:01:52.390 --> 00:01:53.443
We're gonna take that out.

00:01:53.443 --> 00:01:54.360
- No.
- No.

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:56.583
- [Kelly] Sorry.

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:58.029
- Actually, I think we
should leave that in, Kelly.

00:01:58.029 --> 00:01:59.193
- Keeping it daytime.

